    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>主播：桃子 阿面 练练</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>朋友们好久不见，甚是想念♥ ♥ ♥ ~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>先跪下给大家认错，很抱歉消失了两个月</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>这两个月大概是在人间忙忙碌碌寻宝藏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>也许宝藏谈不上，反正离谱也很多</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>离谱台风让人ptsd</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>加班让人怀疑人生</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>生病让人豁然开朗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>老友相聚总是快乐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>还有快乐的塞尔达！！！这个咱们单独开一期哈哈哈哈</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>原本大半个月前就在准备“复出”了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>无奈桃子阳了趴窝了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>所以这期也仓促准备的听听我们的日常离谱、日常焦虑、日常生活吧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如果能达到一些“原来这世界大家都很倒霉”的共情安慰感就也太好了吧</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>音乐推荐：</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>橘子海/椅子乐团 - 一次成像</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkG36jLNHODPxWIg7IAm_uXF_x8V.m4a" length="79905353" type="audio/mp4"/>
